      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The authors compare the performance of PPO and DPO across different datasets and evaluations. They find that <strong>PPO outperforms DPO by an average of 0.7 points</strong>, with improvements in reasoning, coding, and safety capabilities. They also investigate the effect of varying the reward model and policy training prompts on downstream performance.",
